      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WorkflowService · PublicationService · Optimizer\nREST admits versioned workflows, controls publication and exposes trial artifacts.\nWorkflowRuntime scans persisted WORKFLOW rows on a 1 s fixed-delay tick.\nUses A2AClient to delegate, poll and cancel. ORCHESTRATOR also serves its own /a2a.\nOptimizer computes and ranks trials. Role decisions are inputs to that code.",
      "originalText": "WorkflowService · PublicationService · Optimizer\nREST admits versioned workflows, controls publication and exposes trial artifacts.\nWorkflowRuntime scans persisted WORKFLOW rows on a 1 s fixed-delay tick.\nUses A2AClient to delegate, poll and cancel. ORCHESTRATOR also serves its own /a2a.\nOptimizer computes and ranks trials. Role decisions are inputs to that code.",
      "fontSize": 18.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
