      "seed": 221516288,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3276614,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agent HTTP · delegation and budgeting",
      "originalText": "Agent HTTP · delegation and budgeting",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n1-interface-2-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 2149.5,
      "width": 1144,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n1-group-interface-2"
      ],
      "frameId": "n1-frame",
      "index": "b1q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221612595,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3293757,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Request 1.0.0 = {schemaVersion,requestId,workflowId,stepId,planRevision,deadline,payload}.\nThe hub registers STEP with role and request fingerprint. A2A calls use the ORCHESTRATOR bearer token.\nResult fields include workflowId, requestId, stepId, planRevision, decision, observations and model metadata.\nRole → ORCHESTRATOR POST /internal/budget {request,callId,maxTokens} → {reserved:true}.\nRole → ORCHESTRATOR POST /internal/usage {request,callId,actualTokens} → {settled:true}.\nThe ORCHESTRATOR's own agent accounts for usage in process. Other roles use callback HTTP.\nORCHESTRATOR ↔ Research REST /api/v1/ai/policies/* forwards analyst policy operations.\nPOST /api/v1/ai/policies/validate {product,evidenceIds} → {valid:true}.",
      "originalText": "Request 1.0.0 = {schemaVersion,requestId,workflowId,stepId,planRevision,deadline,payload}.\nThe hub registers STEP with role and request fingerprint. A2A calls use the ORCHESTRATOR bearer token.\nResult fields include workflowId, requestId, stepId, planRevision, decision, observations and model metadata.\nRole → ORCHESTRATOR POST /internal/budget {request,callId,maxTokens} → {reserved:true}.\nRole → ORCHESTRATOR POST /internal/usage {request,callId,actualTokens} → {settled:true}.\nThe ORCHESTRATOR's own agent accounts for usage in process. Other roles use callback HTTP.\nORCHESTRATOR ↔ Research REST /api/v1/ai/policies/* forwards analyst policy operations.\nPOST /api/v1/ai/policies/validate {product,evidenceIds} → {valid:true}.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
