      "text": "SendMessage params.message = {messageId, role:\"ROLE_USER\", contextId:workflowId, taskId?, parts:[…]}.\nPart = {mediaType:\"application/json\",data:Request}. GetTask and CancelTask params = {id:taskId}.\nTask carries status and result artifacts. Agent card via GET /.well-known/agent-card.json.",
