      "text": "Bank owner data and optional event ingress",
      "originalText": "Bank owner data and optional event ingress",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n2-interface-1-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2060,
      "y": 4440.5,
      "width": 1290,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n2-group-interface-1"
      ],
      "frameId": "n2-frame",
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 237503250,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6122352,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET /api/v1/storage/events?after={sequence}&limit=100 → {items:[{sequence,eventId,occurredAt,offer,…}], …}.\nOutcomeService reads the bank Offer JVM using its marketing token and checkpoints CURSOR/storage.\nIngest deduplicates eventId and projects ENROLLMENT and SELECTION in DEMO mode.\nCustomer trace GET /api/v1/customers/resolve?reference=… and GET /api/v1/customers/{customerId} resolve bank identity.\nGET /api/v1/decision-responses/{offerId}/history?after=…&limit=100 returns versioned decision history.\nOptional POST /internal/outcomes/events {events:[{schemaVersion,eventId,kind,publicationId,\n    customerKey,businessKey,revision,occurredAt,data,…}]} → ingestion receipts under the outcomes credential.\nPolicy lookup, when selected by Research, uses POST /api/v1/ai/policies/search {query,product} on Simulation Research.",
      "originalText": "GET /api/v1/storage/events?after={sequence}&limit=100 → {items:[{sequence,eventId,occurredAt,offer,…}], …}.\nOutcomeService reads the bank Offer JVM using its marketing token and checkpoints CURSOR/storage.\nIngest deduplicates eventId and projects ENROLLMENT and SELECTION in DEMO mode.\nCustomer trace GET /api/v1/customers/resolve?reference=… and GET /api/v1/customers/{customerId} resolve bank identity.\nGET /api/v1/decision-responses/{offerId}/history?after=…&limit=100 returns versioned decision history.\nOptional POST /internal/outcomes/events {events:[{schemaVersion,eventId,kind,publicationId,\n    customerKey,businessKey,revision,occurredAt,data,…}]} → ingestion receipts under the outcomes credential.\nPolicy lookup, when selected by Research, uses POST /api/v1/ai/policies/search {query,product} on Simulation Research.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
