      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agent HTTP · frozen evidence and budgets",
      "originalText": "Agent HTTP · frozen evidence and budgets",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n2-interface-2-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 4780.5,
      "width": 1353,
      "height": 183.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n2-group-interface-2"
      ],
      "frameId": "n2-frame",
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 237792171,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6173781,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A2A with ORCHESTRATOR bearer uses Request 1.0.0 {schemaVersion,requestId,workflowId,stepId,planRevision,deadline,payload}.\nRole → POST /internal/investigation-tools {request,name,arguments:{}} → registered, scoped evidence.\nThe owner checks role, planRevision and request hash against STEP before returning a snapshot or trace.\nPOST /internal/budget {request,callId,maxTokens}. POST /internal/usage {request,callId,actualTokens}.\nBoth callbacks use the role token. The co-located ORCHESTRATOR agent accounts for usage in process.\nA2A returns a Task. Its artifacts[].parts[].data contains Result with decision, observations and model metadata.\nPerformanceMeasurements computes metrics deterministically. Analyzer and Reflection interpret the results.",
      "originalText": "A2A with ORCHESTRATOR bearer uses Request 1.0.0 {schemaVersion,requestId,workflowId,stepId,planRevision,deadline,payload}.\nRole → POST /internal/investigation-tools {request,name,arguments:{}} → registered, scoped evidence.\nThe owner checks role, planRevision and request hash against STEP before returning a snapshot or trace.\nPOST /internal/budget {request,callId,maxTokens}. POST /internal/usage {request,callId,actualTokens}.\nBoth callbacks use the role token. The co-located ORCHESTRATOR agent accounts for usage in process.\nA2A returns a Task. Its artifacts[].parts[].data contains Result with decision, observations and model metadata.\nPerformanceMeasurements computes metrics deterministically. Analyzer and Reflection interpret the results.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
