      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JDBC projections and bank boundaries",
      "originalText": "JDBC projections and bank boundaries",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n2-interface-3-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2060,
      "y": 4780.5,
      "width": 1294,
      "height": 183.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n2-group-interface-3"
      ],
      "frameId": "n2-frame",
      "index": "b4b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 238081092,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6225210,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Registry reads PUBLICATION by ID and checks analyst. Records are keyed by (kind,id) with optimistic version updates.\nOUTCOME_EVENT, ENROLLMENT, SELECTION and CURSOR store replay-safe demo facts and exchange progress.\nConfigured event ingress writes SOURCE_EVENT and fact kinds such as ASSESSMENT, SELECTION and SOURCE_WATERMARK.\nMeasurement and trace snapshots are content-addressed artifacts. The frozen scope includes a fixed evidence cutoff.\nFOR UPDATE on budgets plus reservations and settlements enforces bounded model calls.\nRole schemas store TASK, TASK_MESSAGE and MODEL_CALL. The Feedback orchestrator owns its own task schema.\nAll connections use the selected bank's runtime credentials, owner URLs and database configuration.",
      "originalText": "Registry reads PUBLICATION by ID and checks analyst. Records are keyed by (kind,id) with optimistic version updates.\nOUTCOME_EVENT, ENROLLMENT, SELECTION and CURSOR store replay-safe demo facts and exchange progress.\nConfigured event ingress writes SOURCE_EVENT and fact kinds such as ASSESSMENT, SELECTION and SOURCE_WATERMARK.\nMeasurement and trace snapshots are content-addressed artifacts. The frozen scope includes a fixed evidence cutoff.\nFOR UPDATE on budgets plus reservations and settlements enforces bounded model calls.\nRole schemas store TASK, TASK_MESSAGE and MODEL_CALL. The Feedback orchestrator owns its own task schema.\nAll connections use the selected bank's runtime credentials, owner URLs and database configuration.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
