      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Browser session and AI REST",
      "originalText": "Browser session and AI REST",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n3-interface-0-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 7071.5,
      "width": 1258,
      "height": 183.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n3-group-interface-0"
      ],
      "frameId": "n3-frame",
      "index": "b78",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 253201291,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8916661,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795365707110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POST /web-api/customer/personalization {profileVersion,message?}. WebServer supplies customerId and sessionId.\nBackend POST /api/v1/ai/customer-personalization/{customerId} → {id,version,state,usage,…}.\n↳ forwards {profileVersion,sessionId,message?}. the owner session must be active for this customer.\nGET …/{customerId}?profileVersion&sessionId reads the latest. GET …/{customerId}/{id}?sessionId reads a specific run.\nPOST …/{id}/messages?sessionId {expectedVersion,questionId,text}. POST …/{id}/cancel?sessionId cancels.\nThe browser calls /web-api/customer/session-offers/{quoteId}/selections to select terms explicitly.\n↳ {requestId,sourceVersion,kind,terms} is validated and recorded by the bank Offer JVM.",
      "originalText": "POST /web-api/customer/personalization {profileVersion,message?}. WebServer supplies customerId and sessionId.\nBackend POST /api/v1/ai/customer-personalization/{customerId} → {id,version,state,usage,…}.\n↳ forwards {profileVersion,sessionId,message?}. the owner session must be active for this customer.\nGET …/{customerId}?profileVersion&sessionId reads the latest. GET …/{customerId}/{id}?sessionId reads a specific run.\nPOST …/{id}/messages?sessionId {expectedVersion,questionId,text}. POST …/{id}/cancel?sessionId cancels.\nThe browser calls /web-api/customer/session-offers/{quoteId}/selections to select terms explicitly.\n↳ {requestId,sourceVersion,kind,terms} is validated and recorded by the bank Offer JVM.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "n3-interface-1",
